    <briefdescription>
<para>Interface for plugging in an LLM-based complexity scorer. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Implement this interface and pass an instance to <ref refid="classthemis_1_1rag_1_1_adaptive_retrieval" kindref="compound">AdaptiveRetrieval</ref> to replace the heuristic scorer. When null, the heuristic is used. </para>
